    "detailed_description": "A police officer goes to investigate an old house where he hears reports of noises and screams, a team was sent before him and they didn't give any feedback, something macabre awaits this police officer.<br />\r\nZombies, monsters from experiments gone wrong and a deadly virus for humans, this mission stopped being a mere report and became an operation to save an entire city from a deadly virus. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Explore the House \u2013 A third-person horror game with scary visuals. <br />\r\n\u2022 Gameplay and Puzzles - Based on great classic Horror games.<br />\r\n\u2022 Innovative story - Despite being inspired by other games, Infected has a unique plot created exclusively for the game's story. \u2022 Survive the horrors \u2013 Scavenge for supplies and weapons to stay alive as you run, hide, or fight strange creatures. <br />\r\n\u2022 Unravel the mystery of the abandoned house \u2013 Secrets will reveal themselves as you progress on your journey.<br />\r\n\u2022 Read texts and documents scattered around the scene to understand what happened in this house.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n A bizarre mystery awaits you in this Horror game, help Gabriel on this journey.",
